    <string name="help_title">Setup &amp; TV Server Guide</string>
    <string name="help_intro">This companion app mirrors your Haier 55P7GT-P Google TV over local Wi-Fi without internet or cloud services.</string>
    <string name="help_step1">1. Enable Developer Options &amp; USB Debugging on your TV (Settings &gt; System &gt; About &gt; Click Build 7 times, then Settings &gt; System &gt; Developer options &gt; USB debugging: ON).</string>
    <string name="help_step2">2. Ensure Phone and TV are on the same Wi-Fi router or Phone Hotspot. Internet connection is NOT required.</string>
    <string name="help_step3">3. Start the TV server once using ADB from your PC or TV terminal:</string>
    <string name="help_cmd1">adb connect &lt;TV_IP&gt;:5555</string>
    <string name="help_cmd2">adb push tv-server.jar /data/local/tmp/tv-server.jar</string>
    <string name="help_cmd3">adb shell CLASSPATH=/data/local/tmp/tv-server.jar app_process / com.example.tvserver.Main 55555 123456</string>
    <string name="help_note">No root required. TV server runs as shell process and automatically captures at 60 FPS.</string>
